 ('app/src/main/java/com/easternwood/dolbomon/RecordActivity.java',
  'case "medication": specialSummary.setText(R.string.special_medication); break;',
  'case "memo": specialSummary.setText(R.string.special_medication); break;'),
 ('app/src/main/java/com/easternwood/dolbomon/RecordActivity.java',
  '        if (selectedActivities.isEmpty()) {\n'
  '            String level = selected(activityLevelGroup);\n'
  '            if ("active".equals(level)) { selectedActivities.add("walk"); selectedActivities.add("program"); }\n'
